5. Urutan E2E yang benar
Phase A — Program deployment
solana config set --url devnet

solana address -k "$PROGRAM_KEYPAIR"
solana address -k "$DEPLOY_WALLET"
solana balance -k "$DEPLOY_WALLET" --url devnet

Pastikan:
public key PROGRAM_KEYPAIR == ASB_PROGRAM_ID
DEPLOY_WALLET memiliki SOL Devnet

Lalu:
DRY_RUN=1 ./scripts/deploy-devnet.sh

Hanya jika lulus:
DEPLOY_DEVNET_CONFIRM=1 ./scripts/deploy-devnet.sh

Setelah broadcast:
solana program show "$ASB_PROGRAM_ID" --url devnet

Signature harus diverifikasi menggunakan RPC getTransaction.

Phase B — UI Vault
Connect Wallet
→ pilih Devnet
→ cek RPC Connected
→ Initialize Vault
→ konfirmasi wallet
→ confirmTransaction
→ tampilkan Explorer link

Validasi yang wajib dilakukan UI:
vault:
  - PDA exists
  - vault authority exists
  - vault token PDA exists
  - token owner == Token-2022 program
  - configured mint matches vault mint

Phase C — Token-2022 deposit
Validate user Token-2022 ATA
→ validate user balance
→ validate vault PDA
→ simulate transaction
→ request wallet approval
→ send transaction
→ confirm transaction
→ refresh vault balance
→ record signature

Jangan mengaktifkan deposit jika:
wallet disconnected
vault uninitialized
mint unavailable
user token account missing
balance insufficient
RPC unavailable

Phase D — Pyth dan PreStocks
Pyth proxy
→ validate feed ID
→ validate price > 0
→ validate exponent
→ validate freshness
→ fetch PreStocks
→ accept only status == LIVE
→ validate mint PublicKey

Jika Pyth gagal:
price: null
rebalance: disabled
ui_status: Offline / Retrying

Tidak boleh menggunakan harga statis.

Phase E — Meteora
Mengacu METEORA_DBC_CONFIG.md:
Validate pool account
→ validate pool owner/program
→ validate base mint
→ validate quote mint
→ validate Token-2022 program
→ fetch quote
→ calculate minimumAmountOut
→ simulate transaction
→ request explicit wallet approval
→ broadcast
→ getTransaction

Pool hanya boleh dianggap valid jika:
pool:
  exists: true
  owner_matches_meteora_program: true
  base_mint_matches_prestocks_asset: true
  quote_mint_matches_config: true
  token_program_matches: true
  minimum_amount_out: greater_than_zero

Phase F — Borrowing dan liquidation
Harness dua fase:
BORROWING_PHASE=borrow ./scripts/borrowing-e2e.sh
BORROWING_PHASE=liquidate ./scripts/borrowing-e2e.sh

Sebelum menjalankan, validasi:
oracle:
  - Pyth price account exists
  - owner matches Pyth program
  - feed ID matches configured feed
  - price is fresh
  - confidence is within limit

borrow:
  - vault initialized
  - borrow pool initialized
  - loan mint exists
  - collateral exists
  - borrower position exists

liquidation:
  - borrower is actually liquidatable
  - liquidation signer authorized
  - bonus bounded
  - transaction confirmed

Jika price drop tidak dapat dibuat secara sah di Devnet, tandai:
BORROW_LIQUIDATION_DEVNET=NOT_PROVEN

Jangan menggunakan fixture lokal sebagai proof Devnet.

Phase G — Clawpump
Mengacu OFFICIAL_REPOS.md:
required:
  - official SDK or CLI identified
  - version pinned
  - official program ID known
  - account list documented
  - transaction builder available
  - simulation successful
  - user approval received
  - Devnet signature confirmed

Jika belum ada SDK/CLI resmi yang dapat diverifikasi:
CLAWPUMP_LIVE=BLOCKED

Jangan mengaktifkan placeholder instruction.

